   "rule": {
    "type": "manual",
    "text": "Complete ANY of the following courses:\n- ASTRON 7A, 7B\n- BIOLOGY 1A and 1AL (must take both), 1B;\n- CHEM 1A and 1AL (must take both), 1B, 3A and 3AL (must take both), 3B and 3BL (must take both), 4A, 4B;\n- MCELLBI 32 and 32L (must take both)\n- PHYSICS 7C, 5C and 5CL (must take both)\n- An upper division course of 3 units or more in any of the following:\n- ASTRON\n- CHEM, excluding 100, 149, 192\n- EPS, excluding C100\n- EECS C191A and C191B\n- INTEGBI, excluding 101, C105, 191\n- MCELLBI, excluding MCELLBI 186B\n- PHYSICS, excluding 100",
